Cell["\<\
NB: \[DoubleStruckP]\[DoubleStruckB], for Chr from a fixed track and fixed {\
\[Theta],\[Phi]}, depends on emission point, but only its module does!!!
NB: {wPntPCPPhoX,wPntPCPPhoY,wPntPCPPhoZ} does not change by rotation around \
the {xc,yc,zc}==pole.
???, for the base point fixed (for instance the BCO)!!!
Noooooooooooo, se cambio centro cambia, e` par. imp.!!!!
O si se scelgo punto base qualunque?????\
\>", "Text",
 $CellContext`InitializationGroup -> 
 True,ExpressionUUID->"30082fd5-724c-42bd-8c63-81812dde8642"]
